{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-avatar",
  "category": "media",
  "title": "<is-avatar>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "styles": "/* Rejilla formas x contenido: se lee como tabla de referencia. */\r\n    .shape-grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: auto repeat(3, minmax(0, max-content));\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 0.9rem 1.6rem;\r\n      font-size: 2.5rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .shape-grid > code.code { font-size: 0.8rem; }\r\n    .shape-grid__head {\r\n      font-size: 0.7rem;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.06em;\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      color: var(--is-text-soft);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* El acento del \"+N\" va en la parte de iniciales, que si respeta la forma. */\r\n    .stack-more::part(initials) {\r\n      background: var(--is-accent);\r\n      color: var(--is-on-accent, #fff);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .fallback-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2rem; }\r\n    .fallback-case {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 0.75rem;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      font-size: 2.5rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .fallback-case figcaption {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-direction: column;\r\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n      line-height: 1.35;\r\n    }\r\n    .fallback-case small { color: var(--is-text-soft); }",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-avatar",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-avatar>",
      "lede": "Avatar con imagen, iniciales o icono fallback. Caja = <code class=\"code\">1em × 1em</code>; escala con <code class=\"code\">font-size</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-row\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:3rem\">\r\n            <is-avatar initials=\"JD\" label=\"Juan Díaz\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=1\" label=\"Usuario demo\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar label=\"Sin foto\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar image=\"https://invalid.example/no.jpg\" initials=\"FB\" label=\"Imagen rota → iniciales\"></is-avatar>\r\n          </div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "Formas",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">shape=\"circle\"</code> · <code class=\"code\">square\"</code> · <code class=\"code\">rounded\"</code> — el border-radius se aplica al contenedor.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"shape-grid\">\r\n            <span class=\"shape-grid__head\"></span>\r\n            <span class=\"shape-grid__head\">imagen</span>\r\n            <span class=\"shape-grid__head\">iniciales</span>\r\n            <span class=\"shape-grid__head\">icono</span>\r\n\r\n            <code class=\"code\">circle</code>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"circle\" image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/120?u=21\" label=\"Ana\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"circle\" initials=\"AN\" label=\"Ana\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"circle\" label=\"Sin datos\"></is-avatar>\r\n\r\n            <code class=\"code\">square</code>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"square\" image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/120?u=22\" label=\"Bea\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"square\" initials=\"BE\" label=\"Bea\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"square\" label=\"Sin datos\"></is-avatar>\r\n\r\n            <code class=\"code\">rounded</code>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"rounded\" image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/120?u=23\" label=\"Caro\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"rounded\" initials=\"CA\" label=\"Caro\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar shape=\"rounded\" label=\"Sin datos\"></is-avatar>\r\n          </div>",
          "heading": "Cada forma con los tres contenidos posibles"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span style=\"font-size:3rem\">\n  <is-avatar initials=\"AB\" shape=\"rounded\"></is-avatar>\n</span>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scale",
      "title": "Escala con font-size",
      "lede": "Como la caja es <code class=\"code\">1em × 1em</code>, basta con subir el <code class=\"code\">font-size</code> del padre.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-row\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap\">\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:1rem\"><is-avatar initials=\"XS\" label=\"XS\"></is-avatar></span>\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:1.5rem\"><is-avatar initials=\"SM\" label=\"SM\"></is-avatar></span>\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:2rem\"><is-avatar initials=\"MD\" label=\"MD\"></is-avatar></span>\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:3rem\"><is-avatar initials=\"LG\" label=\"LG\"></is-avatar></span>\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:4rem\"><is-avatar initials=\"XL\" label=\"XL\"></is-avatar></span>\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:6rem\"><is-avatar initials=\"XXL\" label=\"XXL\"></is-avatar></span>\r\n          </div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sources",
      "title": "Origen del contenido",
      "lede": "Prioridad: <code class=\"code\">image</code> → <code class=\"code\">initials</code> → slot <code class=\"code\">icon</code>. Si la imagen falla al cargar, emite <code class=\"code\">is-error</code> y cae a <code class=\"code\">initials</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-row\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:3rem\">\r\n            <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=2\" label=\"Foto\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar initials=\"NS\" label=\"Sin foto, iniciales\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar label=\"Solo icono\">\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"icon\" icon=\"mdi:cog\"></is-icon>\r\n            </is-avatar>\r\n          </div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stacks",
      "title": "Stack / group de avatares",
      "lede": "Varios avatares juntos con margin-left negativo, como en chats o listas.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:2rem;padding:0.5rem\">\r\n            <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=10\" label=\"Ana\" shape=\"circle\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=11\" label=\"Bea\" shape=\"circle\" style=\"margin-left:-0.6em\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=12\" label=\"Carol\" shape=\"circle\" style=\"margin-left:-0.6em\"></is-avatar>\r\n            <!-- El acento va en ::part(initials), NO en el host: el host es\r\n                 cuadrado y pintarle el fondo dejaba un rectangulo asomando\r\n                 por detras del circulo. -->\r\n            <is-avatar class=\"stack-more\" initials=\"+5\" label=\"5 más\" shape=\"circle\" style=\"margin-left:-0.6em\"></is-avatar>\r\n          </div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "list",
      "title": "Patrón lista de usuarios",
      "lede": "Avatar + nombre + email, alineado con la línea base.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem\">\r\n            <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\">\r\n              <span style=\"font-size:2rem\">\r\n                <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=20\" label=\"Lucía\" shape=\"circle\"></is-avatar>\r\n              </span>\r\n              <span>\r\n                <div><strong>Lucía Gómez</strong></div>\r\n                <div style=\"font-size:0.85em;opacity:0.7\">lucia.gomez@demo.com</div>\r\n              </span>\r\n            </li>\r\n            <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\">\r\n              <span style=\"font-size:2rem\">\r\n                <is-avatar initials=\"MR\" label=\"Marcos\" shape=\"circle\"></is-avatar>\r\n              </span>\r\n              <span>\r\n                <div><strong>Marcos Reyes</strong></div>\r\n                <div style=\"font-size:0.85em;opacity:0.7\">marcos.reyes@demo.com</div>\r\n              </span>\r\n            </li>\r\n            <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\">\r\n              <span style=\"font-size:2rem\">\r\n                <is-avatar image=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?u=21\" label=\"Sara\" shape=\"rounded\"></is-avatar>\r\n              </span>\r\n              <span>\r\n                <div><strong>Sara Pereira</strong></div>\r\n                <div style=\"font-size:0.85em;opacity:0.7\">sara.pereira@demo.com</div>\r\n              </span>\r\n            </li>\r\n          </ul>"
        }
      ]
